~ Start
# Yarn tags: intro
# The guard at the gate.
Guard: Halt! Who goes there? [#stern] [ID:g01]
- I'm a friend. [ID:g02]
	Guard: Pass, friend.
	set friend = true
- None of your business. [if rude == true]
	Guard: Then turn back.
	=> Gate
if friend
	Guard: Welcome, {{name}}.
elif gold > 10
	Guard: Nice purse.
else
	Guard: Move along.
# <<wait 1>>
The gate creaks\: slowly.
if friend
	Guard: Off you go. [ID:g03]
=> Gate

~ Gate
The gate opens.
# <<declare $gold = 0>>
=>< Start
=> END!
